## Module 1: Professional profiles

Allow users to:
- Create professional profiles.
- Add personal and professional information.
- Record education and qualifications.
- Add work experience.
- Record technical and transferable skills.
- Add languages.
- State career interests and goals.
- Edit and update profile information.

Create a professional dashboard showing:
- Profile completeness ring.
- Uploaded document count.
- Identified skills.
- Evidence-strength indicator.
- Recognition preparation progress.
- Recommended next actions.
- Relevant opportunities.

All information must persist in the database.

## Module 2: Document and evidence management

Allow users to upload:
- CVs.
- Academic certificates.
- Professional certificates.
- Reference letters.
- Employment records.
- Work samples.
- Training certificates.
- Other supporting evidence.

Implement:
- Secure private storage.
- User-specific access permissions.
- File type and size validation.
- Upload progress indicators.
- Document previews where supported.
- Document deletion.
- Document categorisation.
- Document status tracking.

Extract relevant information from uploaded documents where technically possible.

